# AIDevMe Order Management API, local run without authentication:
#   ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development dotnet run --project src/order-api/src/AIDevMe.OrderApi --urls http://localhost:5090
@base = http://localhost:5090

### find_orders: the customer's orders, newest first
GET {{base}}/customers/CU-3001/orders?status=Any

### get_order_status: includes customerId, so Logic Apps can check ownership
GET {{base}}/orders/SO-10023

### Another customer's order, with the header API Management sets: 404
GET {{base}}/orders/SO-10027
AIDevMe-Customer-Id: CU-3001

### create_return: 201 and the RMA
POST {{base}}/orders/SO-10023/returns
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lineNumber": 1, "quantity": 1, "reason": "Damaged", "comment": "The kettle arrived broken." }

### Outside the 30-day window: 422 return_window_closed
POST {{base}}/orders/SO-10019/returns
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lineNumber": 1, "quantity": 1, "reason": "Damaged" }

### Internal: External ID oid -> customer ID (API Management's OAuth policy, Part 3)
GET {{base}}/customers/by-identity/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000003001
